    "title": "January 5, 2026 City Council Meeting Report - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jim Helmen, Vernonia School District Superintendent ,\n9 hours ago Citizen of the Month -– Councilor Dennis Weller selected Chuck Heath as Citizen of the Month for his work to help restore the Vernonia Golf Course. Topics From the Floor – Adam Strathdee told the Council he recently purchased property in Vernonia on 1st Avenue. He told the Council the property does not have a structure on it, but he intends to build a home in the future. He had some questions about the access to his property and the requirements to develop it. City Administrator Josette Mitchell said she would discuss Strathdee’s concerns with him. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
